<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Legit rust macro for AK47, not fully lasered spray pattern.

How to use:
1. Download the file 
2. Add it to macro editor
3. Bind it to a key of choice (I recommend mouse wheel)
4. Make sure you set the program to incognito mode (in settings)
5. Run the program and enjoy!

Use FOV of 85
Sensitivity:
Iron 0.66
Homemade 0.53
Holo 0.80</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
